#: docs/app/content/guide/releases/upgrade-to-v6.mdx
msgid ""
"<0/> and <1/> now look gray and muted blue. In Ardo 5 both were a saturated "
"blue."
msgstr ""
"<0/> et <1/> sont gris et bleu atténué, au lieu du bleu saturé d’Ardo 5."

#: docs/app/content/guide/theming.mdx
msgid ""
"<0/> and <1/> take imported files. Vite gives them fingerprinted URLs, so "
"browsers pick up a new logo after the next deploy instead of serving a cached "
"one. Here the logo doubles as the favicon; pass a square mark to <2/> when "
"your logo is a wordmark."
msgstr ""
"<0/> et <1/> prennent des fichiers importés. Vite ajoute un fingerprint aux "
"URL pour renouveler le cache au déploiement. Ici, le logo sert de favicon ; "
"pour un logo textuel, passez une marque carrée à <2/>."

