#: docs/app/content/guide/configuration.mdx
msgid ""
"External links are out of scope, because their availability depends on "
"third-party servers rather than on the build. Links to the other versions in "
"<0><1/></0> count as present, because each version is deployed on its own. A "
"link that leaves the deployment base, such as <2/> on a site served below "
"<3/>, is reported. Each finding names the file and line it comes from."
msgstr ""
"Les liens externes sont exclus car leur disponibilité dépend de serveurs "
"tiers. Les autres versions de <0><1/></0> sont considérées comme présentes,"
" chacune étant déployée séparément. Un lien hors de la base de "
"déploiement, tel <2/> sous <3/>, est signalé. Chaque diagnostic indique le "
"fichier et la ligne."

#: docs/app/content/guide/internationalization.mdx
msgid ""
"Extraction updates source messages and preserves existing translations. Edit "
"the guide catalogs in <0/>; shared UI and the interactive example use <1/>. "
"The audit checks missing translations, ICU syntax, and rich-text placeholders."
" The Vite plugin regenerates routes after source or PO edits. Build the site "
"and run the language-switching browser tests before submitting changes."
msgstr ""
"L’extraction met à jour les messages sources et conserve les traductions. "
"Modifiez les catalogues des guides dans <0/> ; l’interface commune et "
"l’exemple interactif utilisent <1/>. L’audit vérifie traductions "
